        <UserObject id="e2e-title" label='&lt;b&gt;E2E flow: every component, every flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;Generated from docs/flows/flows.yaml by &lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;just flows&lt;/font&gt;; do not edit.&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Paths:&lt;/b&gt; each flow is a path through the components that act in its steps, coloured by family.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Arrow labels:&lt;/b&gt; x.y = flow x, step y (the step the arrow leads into, numbered as on the flow&amp;#x27;s page). Hover an arrow for the step.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dashed lines:&lt;/b&gt; not steps; a component the flow runs on, is owned by or depends on, joined to the flow&amp;#x27;s nearest actor.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Layers panel:&lt;/b&gt; hide or show each family.&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;[back to Overview]' link="data:page/id,overview"><mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=13;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;bendable=0;editable=0;deletable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="-102" width="1712" height="182" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
