        <UserObject id="ask-head" label="&lt;b&gt;2. An ask waits on the operator and blocks its work&lt;/b&gt; (custom)&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;A decision or approval the operator owns is an ASK item, never only chat (guidelines 3.1).&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Trigger:&lt;/b&gt; manual: Work needs an operator decision, approval, bench time or review&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Runs on:&lt;/b&gt; Agent session · &lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; Operator&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Depends on components:&lt;/b&gt; pad CLI, Pad web UI, Repo trackers and CHANGELOG&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;[back to Overview]" link="data:page/id,overview"><mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;bendable=0;editable=0;deletable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="1710" height="149" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
