        <UserObject id="bug-head" label="&lt;b&gt;3. A bug from report to fixed and live&lt;/b&gt; (custom)&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;Bugs live in Pad; the tracker file is generated (convention pad-owned-trackers).&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Trigger:&lt;/b&gt; manual: A defect is seen, by the operator, an audit or an agent&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Runs on:&lt;/b&gt; Agent session · &lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; Agent session&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Depends on components:&lt;/b&gt; pad CLI, Generated trackers, Commit gate&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;[back to Overview]" link="data:page/id,overview"><mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;bendable=0;editable=0;deletable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="1850" height="149" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
