        <UserObject id="tracker-export-head" label="&lt;b&gt;4. Bug and feature trackers generated from Pad&lt;/b&gt; (custom)&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;bug-tracker.md and features-to-add.md stay readable in the repo while Pad holds the truth (operator, 2026-11-10).&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Trigger:&lt;/b&gt; manual: just commit-project runs the commit gate&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Runs on:&lt;/b&gt; Commit gate · &lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; pad_tracker.py&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Budget:&lt;/b&gt; under 1 s per file&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Depends on components:&lt;/b&gt; pad CLI, Generated trackers&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;[back to Overview]" link="data:page/id,overview"><mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;bendable=0;editable=0;deletable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="1570" height="164" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
