        <UserObject id="tracker-export-s-gate" label='&lt;span style="font-size:125%"&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. gate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;Runs just pad-trackers --apply.&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;via CLI&lt;/i&gt;' tooltip='&lt;b&gt;4.1 gate (Commit gate)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Runs just pad-trackers &lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;--apply&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Via:&lt;/b&gt; CLI&lt;/div&gt;'><mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=6;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=36;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;bendable=0;editable=0;deletable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="248" width="220" height="97" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <UserObject id="tracker-export-s-read" label='&lt;span style="font-size:125%"&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. read&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;• Lists the collection (--all --full) and rebuilds each section&amp;#x27;s item tree&lt;br&gt;• an item made in Pad renders its title, its body under it.&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;via CLI&lt;/i&gt;' tooltip='&lt;b&gt;4.2 read (&lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;pad_tracker.py&lt;/font&gt;)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Lists the collection (&lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;--all&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;--full&lt;/font&gt;) and rebuilds each section&amp;#x27;s item tree; an item made in Pad renders its title, its body under it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Via:&lt;/b&gt; CLI&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Code:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;scripts/​pad_​tracker.​py&lt;/font&gt;:​&lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;from_​pad&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;'><mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=6;rounded=0;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;bendable=0;editable=0;deletable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="530" y="411.5" width="220" height="127" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="tracker-export-n-read" value='&lt;b&gt;2. read&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Code&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;scripts/​pad_​tracker.​py:​from_​pad&lt;/font&gt;' style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=10;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#bf9000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;bendable=0;editable=0;deletable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="492" y="782" width="296" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="tracker-export-s-write" label='&lt;span style="font-size:125%"&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. write&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;Rewrites each generated block, keeping the hand-written text around it.&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;via file&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;GATE: no generated block edited by hand&lt;/b&gt;' tooltip="&lt;b&gt;4.3 write (&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;pad_tracker.py&lt;/font&gt;)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Rewrites each generated block, keeping the hand-written text around it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gate:&lt;/b&gt; no generated block edited by hand&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Via:&lt;/b&gt; file&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Writes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:2px 0 2px 0;padding-left:16px;'&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;docs/​trackers/​bug-​tracker.​md&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;docs/​trackers/​features-​to-​add.​md&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fails:&lt;/b&gt; a hand edit inside a block stops the gate (exit 1)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Code:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;scripts/​pad_​tracker.​py&lt;/font&gt;:​&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;export_​text&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tags="decision gate fails"><mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=6;strokeWidth=2;rhombus;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=72;spacingRight=72;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=95;spacingRight=95;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;bendable=0;editable=0;deletable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="830" y="373" width="380" height="204" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="tracker-export-n-write" value='&lt;b&gt;3. write&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Writes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• docs/​trackers/​bug-​tracker.​md&lt;br&gt;• docs/​trackers/​features-​to-​add.​md&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Code&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;scripts/​pad_​tracker.​py:​export_​text&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fails&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• a hand edit inside a block stops the gate (exit 1)' style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=10;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#bf9000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;bendable=0;editable=0;deletable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="792" y="782" width="456" height="163" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
