        <UserObject id="conventions-apply-s-read" label='&lt;span style="font-size:125%"&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. read&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;• Loads the baseline (apn-baseline.toml or an adapted file) and fills {project} and {trackers}&lt;br&gt;• the trackers text is read from the workspace&amp;#x27;s own trackers-truth first.&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;via file&lt;/i&gt;' tooltip='&lt;b&gt;7.1 read (&lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;pad_conventions.py&lt;/font&gt;)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Loads the baseline (apn-baseline.toml or an adapted file) and fills {project} and {trackers}; the trackers text is read from the workspace&amp;#x27;s own trackers-truth first.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Via:&lt;/b&gt; file&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fails:&lt;/b&gt; a new &lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;--trackers&lt;/font&gt; value overwrites a fuller list&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Code:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;scripts/​pad_​conventions.​py&lt;/font&gt;:​&lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;load_​baseline&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;' tags="fails"><mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=6;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=36;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;bendable=0;editable=0;deletable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="248" width="220" height="175" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
