        <UserObject id="links-pass-head" label="&lt;b&gt;9. References made clickable&lt;/b&gt; (custom)&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;Every item, decision or record named in a body or an agent comment is a [[REF]] link (operator, 2026-11-20).&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Trigger:&lt;/b&gt; manual: just links --since &amp;lt;date&amp;gt; [--apply]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Runs on:&lt;/b&gt; Agent session · &lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; pad_links.py&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Budget:&lt;/b&gt; about 50 s for a 240-item workspace&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Depends on components:&lt;/b&gt; pad CLI&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;[back to Overview]" link="data:page/id,overview"><mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;bendable=0;editable=0;deletable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="1110" height="164" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
